    [BugFix] Use source installation doctests for release version updates (#19905)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Release configuration updates in `mkdocs.yml` currently select pip
    installation doctests. When the CANN image is available but the vLLM
    Ascend wheel has not been published yet, these tests still run and fail
    during installation.
    
    Select source installation instead to reuse the existing source-ref
    availability check: PR runs skip the affected source installation cases
    and report the missing ref when the configured release tag is not
    available. Once the ref exists, the tests build from source without
    waiting for the vLLM Ascend wheel to be published.
    
